<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 12-mth T-bill yield falls to 22.41 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 12-mth T-bill yield falls to 22.41 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on the latest issue of twelve-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 22.41 percent, down from 23.69 percent at an auction two weeks ago, the Debt Management Agency said.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     14,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received	37,652.99 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	    14,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 15,500 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    22.41 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     81.8158 pct</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
